{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["A night of watchfulness it is to YHWH — from the days of their fathers the Holy One, blessed be He, was waiting for this night to bring the children of Israel out of Egypt, as He promised them. And to Israel it is a night of watchfulness." "לדורותם — for all their generations, who wait for this night to celebrate in it the festival of Passover according to its ordinances." "שמורים — a term of waiting, like: ואביו שמר את הדבר."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:16.993259635Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}